1
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:05,020
Indicators are extra lines that help you read the chart. Click Indicators.

2
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:08,690
There are dozens, in groups: trend, momentum, volatility, volume and more.

3
00:00:08,790 --> 00:00:11,120
Type part of the name to find one.

4
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:16,310
Click it and it appears on your chart straight away.

5
00:00:16,410 --> 00:00:18,970
Each indicator gets a small tag on the chart.

6
00:00:19,070 --> 00:00:24,350
The eye hides it for a moment. Click again to show it.

7
00:00:24,450 --> 00:00:27,510
The gear opens its settings, such as the period and colour.

8
00:00:27,610 --> 00:00:31,040
The X removes it.

9
00:00:31,140 --> 00:00:38,210
The pencil button hides or shows the drawing tools on the left.

